{{Passive skill box|Bastion of Hope}}

'''Bastion of Hope''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Guardian]] that grants yourself and nearby [[ally|allies]] additional attack or spell [[block]] chance if you've used an [[attack]] or [[spell]] [[recently]], respectively.

==Interactions==
Bastion of Hope will not work with attacks or spells that are [[trigger|triggered]]. A provided example for spells is utilizing {{il|Mjölner}} with a socketed {{il|Arc}}- using an attack with Mjölner will grant '''Bastion of Hope's''' Attack Block Chance, but will not do so for its Spell Block Chance. This same interaction also occurs with the usage of any channelling attack, such as {{il|Cyclone}}, linked with {{il|Cast while Channelling Support}} and any non-channelling spell. The inverse will also occur when casting a spell that triggers an attack, such as a {{il|Toxic Rain}} triggered by {{il|Replica Maloney's Mechanism}}.

